Dear all,

I'd like to ask you the following question. One of
our customers uses two ESA12000s with dual-redundant
controller configurations and DRM between the two
ESAs. The four HSOFs have a version 8.61P (or similar).
Two HSGs in one rack have to be replaced along with
the program cards. We are thinking about upgrading
the HSOFs to 8.74P (or similar) in one array only.
Question: will the DRM remain functional between the
two different versions, or do the other two
controllers have to be upgraded too?

I can't remember the two versions exaclty, but the
question is general: will the DRM be functional
between different versions? Can I find a compatibility
matrix or something similar on the net?

Thank you in advance,
Regards,

Akos Nagy
Getronics Hungary Ltd.



