Hi all,

the first summary resulted in more replies than the original post.

One thing I want to clarify:
the support for WORM drives wasn't dropped, because it never was part of =
the base system.
The layered product (CLC)  providing support was discontinued silently =
and only partly (for the media changers) incorporated in the base system =
(as the SPD correctly states).

Nevertheless: WORM media can't be used with Tru64 V5 anymore and =
customers with optical jukeboxes have a problem.

Arno Thuermann


