Dear all,

No answers at all through mail... :-(
Nevertheless I made some researches, and
found that the only rule is that the two
controllers within the same array must
be identical along with their program
cards, but the HSOF versions between separate
arrays can be different. (This summary is
for the archives, should anyone care...)

Regards,

Akos Nagy
Getronics Hungary Ltd.


